<div class="ex"><p class="xtt">Judging, not counting</p><p class="xl">A glossary translates <i>dataset</i> as <span lang="fr"><i>ensemble de données</i></span>. A system translates this short text into French: it writes <span lang="fr"><i>jeu de données</i></span> four times, a correct synonym, and <span lang="fr"><i>base de données</i></span> once, which means <i>database</i>.</p><div class="xt"><div><p class="xh">English</p><p>We introduce a new <mark class="hs">dataset<sup>1</sup></mark> of scientific abstracts. The <mark class="hs">dataset<sup>2</sup></mark> contains abstracts in English and French. Each abstract in the <mark class="hs">dataset<sup>3</sup></mark> was annotated by two linguists. We split the <mark class="hs">dataset<sup>4</sup></mark> by year of publication. The <mark class="hs">dataset<sup>5</sup></mark> is available online.</p></div><div lang="fr"><p class="xh" lang="en">French translation</p><p>Nous présentons un nouveau <mark class="ht">jeu de données<sup>1</sup></mark> de résumés scientifiques. Le <mark class="ht">jeu de données<sup>2</sup></mark> contient des résumés en anglais et en français. Chaque résumé de la <mark class="he">base de données<sup>3</sup></mark> a été annoté par deux linguistes. Nous avons divisé le <mark class="ht">jeu de données<sup>4</sup></mark> par année de publication. Le <mark class="ht">jeu de données<sup>5</sup></mark> est disponible en ligne.</p></div></div><ol class="sp">{% for o in [['jeu de données','JUSTIFIED','first mention, nothing to be inconsistent with'],['jeu de données','JUSTIFIED','document usage: same translation as earlier in the document'],['base de données','ERROR','database, a wrong related term'],['jeu de données','JUSTIFIED','document usage: same translation as earlier in the document'],['jeu de données','JUSTIFIED','document usage: same translation as earlier in the document']] %}<li{% if o[1] == 'ERROR' %} class="spe"{% endif %}><span class="n">{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="t" lang="fr">{{ o[0] }}</span><span class="m">mismatch</span><span class="v">{{ o[1] }}</span><span class="w">{{ o[2] }}</span></li>{% endfor %}</ol><p class="xf">Exact matching compares each occurrence with the glossary. It finds five mismatches and treats them alike. TermJudge judges each mismatch: one error and four justified variations.</p><p class="xs"><span><b>Exact matching</b> 5 mismatches</span><span class="xs2"><b>TermJudge</b> 1 error, 4 justified variations</span></p></div>
